	(property "Design notes" "TPS3808G01 command qualification timer. CT connected to VDD through 49.9k gives 180/300/420 ms release delay after ZERO_RAW rises. MR going low resets immediately; no passive diode residual/stale RC permission. SENSE directly monitors VDD >0.405 V; separate G33 supervisor enforces valid logic supply."
